        <label>Vizegraf</label>
        <description>Vizegraf is the third tier of the Oberonia Aureaf aristocratic system, as well as the middle tier of the Oberonia Aureaf Empire. \n\nBeing a mid-level noble of the Oberonia Aurea Empire, the Vizegraf was already qualified enough to be in the palace and to be responsible for the handling of local government affairs. The descendants of Vizegraf are often required to undergo a semi-compulsory noble education at the court to ensure that they will not do anything to bring the noble system into disrepute. \n\nMost of the time the Vizegraf is a downgrade from the side line of the Markgraf family, and the Freiherr may not be able to be promoted to Vizegraf unless they have contributed to the development of Oberonia Aurea many times over, or saved a small-scale catastrophe.</description>
