        <description>The External Hochadel was the fifth level of the Oberonia Aurea aristocratic system, as well as one of the Oberonia Aurea high-level aristocrats. \n\nIn the Oberonia Aurea Empire, an External Hochadel noble was often required to be in charge of the control of a remote planet, or to co-manage a prosperous planet. Even on the home planet of the Oberonia Aurea Empire, the External Hochadel are allowed free access to the external court. \n\nThe vast majority of the External Hochadel have a blood lineage with the royal family of the Oberonia Aurea Empire, and only a very small number of existences in the entire empire are able to become an External Hochadel by way of promotion rather than demotion. The External Hochadel is also the highest title that a non-royal bloodline can achieve.</description>
