        <label>Inner Hochadel</label>
        <description>The Inner Hochadel was the sixth level of the Oberonia Aurea aristocratic system, as well as the high-ranking aristocrats who had access to the core of the Oberonia Aurea Empire. All Inner Hochadel Clans have a blood lineage with the Imperial Family. \n\nUnlike other local nobles, most Inner Hochadel are not in charge of managing specific planets, but rather act as an extension of the Imperial Family, going to represent the Imperial Family to conduct diplomacy, or to patrol and administer some of the planets. Some Inner Hochadel that are recognized by the Imperial Family, are allowed to participate in the core decision-making of the Oberonia Aurea Empire. \n\n On the home planet of the Oberonia Aurea Empire, the Inner Hochadel were allowed free access to all areas except the core court, while the total number of Inner Hochadel would not increase in any way.</description>
